# TNT Run 
on walking on green concrete or yellow concrete or red concrete or gray concrete:
	if {minigames::system::active} is "TNT Run":
		wait 5 tick
		set event-block to air
		add 1 to {minigames::tntrun::blocksbroken::%uuid of player%}

on player move:
	if y-coordinate of location of player < -48:
		{minigames::system::active} is "TNT Run"
		mg_eliminate(player)